---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

const updated = '24 August 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="HEKLA sets no cookies, runs no analytics and loads no trackers. The only personal data we receive is what you type into the contact form or send us directly."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="crumbs">
        <a href="/">&larr; Front page</a>
        <span class="label"><span class="tick" aria-hidden="true"></span>Privacy</span>
      </p>
      <h1>Privacy <span class="erupt">policy</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Short version: this site sets no cookies, runs no analytics and loads no trackers. The only
        personal data we receive is what you type into the contact form or send us directly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="prose">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
      <p>
        The data controller is {site.legalName}, trading as {site.name}, CVR {site.cvr}, {site.address.city},
        {site.address.country}. Registered at {site.address.street}, {site.address.postal}.
      </p>
      <p>Questions about your data: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>

      <h2>What we collect and why</h2>
      <p>
        When you use the contact form, we receive your name, email address, company name and your
        message. We use it for one thing: answering your enquiry and, if you want, arranging a
        conversation. The legal basis is our legitimate interest in responding to people who contact
        us, under GDPR article 6(1)(f).
      </p>
      <p>If you email or call us directly, we handle that correspondence the same way.</p>

      <h2>What we do not collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>No cookies, of any kind.</li>
        <li>No analytics or visitor tracking.</li>
        <li>No advertising pixels or third party trackers.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        The site loads the Inter typeface from Google Fonts, which means your browser sends a
        standard font request to Google when the page loads. If we later self host the fonts, this
        section gets shorter.
      </p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        We keep enquiry correspondence for as long as the dialogue is active, and delete it no later
        than 12 months after the last contact, unless it becomes part of a client engagement with its
        own agreement.
      </p>

      <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>
        Nobody, for marketing. Your enquiry may pass through our email provider and, if the contact
        form is connected, a form processing service. Today that is our email host only. If we add a
        form processing service, it is named here before it goes live.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under GDPR you can ask for access to the data we hold about you, ask us to correct it or
        delete it, and object to our processing. Write to
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and we will handle it within a month. You can
        also complain to Datatilsynet, the Danish Data Protection Agency, at
        <a href="https://www.datatilsynet.dk" rel="noopener">datatilsynet.dk</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If this policy changes, the new version is published here with a new date. This version:
        {updated}.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: 72px 0 40px;
  }

  .crumbs {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .crumbs a {
    font-weight: var(--w-structure);
    font-size: 13px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ash);
  }

  .crumbs a:hover {
    color: var(--black);
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    font-weight: var(--w-display);
    letter-spacing: var(--track-display);
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5.6vw, 68px);
    line-height: 1.08;
    margin: 8px 0 22px;
  }

  .page-hero .lead {
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .prose {
    padding: 24px 0 88px;
  }

  .prose h2 {
    font-weight: var(--w-structure);
    font-size: 20px;
    margin: 36px 0 10px;
  }

  .prose p,
  .prose li {
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .prose ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-hero {
      padding: 56px 0 32px;
    }
  }
</style>
